WEBVTT

00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:02.490
Kujo Hermes.

00:00:03.450 --> 00:00:07.250
This coupon adds a shipping charge it shouldn’t. Give Hermes

00:00:07.250 --> 00:00:08.730
a check it can prove.

00:00:10.250 --> 00:00:14.570
Spec defines the task contract. You approve the repository

00:00:14.570 --> 00:00:15.290
checks.

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:20.530
Eval runs the tests and catches the overcharge.

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:27.330
Hermes fixes the calculation using a free local model. The

00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:29.010
tests stay unchanged.

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:32.330
The same checks now pass.

00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:42.090
Keep the commands, results and evidence hashes after the chat

00:00:42.090 --> 00:00:42.890
ends.

00:00:45.250 --> 00:00:49.010
Discover Scout to inspect repositories, PackWrite to prepare

00:00:49.010 --> 00:00:52.690
context, and ShipCheck to review release readiness.

00:00:54.250 --> 00:00:58.330
With Hermes, Kujo and Git installed, add the plugin, run

00:00:58.330 --> 00:01:00.410
setup, and accept the prompts.

00:01:03.350 --> 00:01:08.790
Kujo. Trust at the speed of AI. Install Kujo Hermes today.
